-county"],["ARC or PLC in Hidalgo County","/arc-plc/texas/hidalgo-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2026 so far, the middle had January to February at 8% of normal and April to May at 184%. Grid 7627 had its driest year in 2011 at 38% of normal.</p>"}
